@fn check
@purpose Top-level entry. Orchestrates the 4-pass pipeline (plus pre-pass) and returns a CheckResult with the fully populated store, registries, and diagnostics.
@pre tokens are lexically valid; index is a populated DeclIndex; pool contains the parsed AST; table is an initialized SymbolTable. [src: checker.aria:5209-5225]
@post Returns CheckResult with complete TypeStore, TypeRegistry, TraitRegistry, and DiagnosticBag. [src: checker.aria:5227]
@complexity O(N) per pass (N = decl count); pass 3 dominates, scales with fn body sizes.
@thread_safety immutable — inputs are read-only; Checker flows by value. [src: checker.aria:5209]
@antipatterns Do not call check() twice on the same input expecting incremental update — the Checker is stateless across calls.

