@fn store_add_canonical
@purpose Add a type with container-deduplication. Returns (possibly unchanged) store + canonical type ID.
@pre info is a valid TypeInfo; container kinds must have their type_id fields filled. [src: types.aria:250]
@post Returns StoreAddResult. If store.types.len() >= STORE_CAP, id = TY_UNKNOWN. [src: types.aria:250-262]
@complexity O(store.types.len()) on first add (linear dedup scan); O(1) on existing. [src: types.aria:219-262]
@antipatterns Calling store_add directly for Array/Optional/Result bypasses dedup and risks store explosion. [src: types.aria:245-262]

