@fn resolve_type_name
@purpose Map a type-name string to a type ID. Hash-index fast path with linear-scan fallback from index 17 (first user type). [src: types.aria:479-527]
@post Returns id >= 1 (primitive) or >= 17 (user type); TY_UNKNOWN if not yet registered.
@complexity O(1) average; O(store.types.len()) worst-case. [src: types.aria:479-527]
@antipatterns Called too early in pass 1 returns TY_UNKNOWN; callers must either gate on pass or tolerate unknown. [src: checker.aria:597-653]

