@fn populate_builtins
@purpose Initialize TraitRegistry with built-in traits (Eq, Ord, Hash, Add, Sub, Mul, Div, Mod, Numeric, Clone, Debug, Display, Drop, Send, Share, error-category traits) plus blanket impls for primitive types. [src: traits.aria:238-321]
@pre reg is a freshly new_trait_registry(). [src: traits.aria:238]
